        dat("THE WRITE hireling_oppression_barred — a BLOCK on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DK2); the_four_prohibitions a DATA row (278:1 — the reading's find 8); the_resident_alien a DATA row (under on his day, not until morning — the Leviticus cell's forward reading); the exam's person the employer who withholds his sojourner's wage past the night — under this verse's 'on his day', not Leviticus's 'until morning'")
