        dat("THE WRITE hireling_wage_same_day_commanded — a STATUS on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DK2); THE PARAMETER the_wages_windows (the day's wage all the night, the night's all the day — 279:1); cry_heard and bears_sin the references, never a third write; the exam's person the employer who pays the day laborer at midnight — within the window, accepted")
        return out("on his day you shall give his wage (24:15) — the two windows: the day's wage all the night, the night's all the day; he hung from the tree for it; the cry and the sin 15:9's, references (the Sifrei 279:1-4; holiness' %s and release_firstborn's row by CALL): THE WRITE hireling_wage_same_day_commanded, a STATUS on Israel at the chapters' own day; the payment at midnight accepted" % (HO_MORNING[0],), ['hireling_wage_same_day_commanded'])
