        dat("THE WRITE fathers_for_sons_death_barred — a BLOCK on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DK2); THE PARAMETER the_relatives_disqualified (Sanhedrin 3:4 — the list, R. Akiva's version, the relative who became unrelated); the pointer 24:16 -> 2 Kings 14:6 OWED (no pointer row this sitting — the lean pass's debt line); the exam's person the father who testifies against his son — disqualified, the son not put to death by his mouth")
