        dat("THE WRITES stranger_orphan_justice_commanded (a STATUS) and widows_garment_pledge_barred (a BLOCK) on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DK2); the_prohibitions_count a DATA row (two for the sojourner, three for the sojourner-orphan — 281:1-2); judgment_wresting_barred the reference; the exam's person the creditor who pledges a rich widow's garment — barred, rich or poor")
